  "cells": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# Manim 对象与动画图鉴\n\n这是一个按本项目 `*.manim.ipynb` 结构编写的综合示例。它面向已经能运行 `demo.manim.ipynb`、希望快速查阅常用 Manim 对象与动画组合的读者。\n\n运行前请在右上角选择安装了 Manim 的 Python 环境，然后从上到下执行。你将依次看到：\n\n1. 2D 基础图元与编组排版；\n2. 线、箭头、角度、尺寸标注与布尔运算；\n3. 文本、Typst 数学公式与数字动画；\n4. 坐标轴、函数、面积、参数曲线与向量场；\n5. Transform、路径动画、强调效果和速率函数；\n6. ValueTracker、updater、LaggedStart、AnimationGroup 与 Succession；\n7. BarChart、Table 和外部 SVG 资源。\n\nTypst 行内公式：$e^(i pi) + 1 = 0$\n\nTypst 块公式：\n\n$$ integral_a^b f(x) dif x = F(b) - F(a) $$",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterCellType": "python"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "import numpy as np\n\nPALETTE = [\"#58C4DD\", \"#83C167\", \"#FFFF00\", \"#FC6255\", \"#9A72AC\", \"#FF862F\"]\n\ndef clear_stage(scene, run_time=0.35):\n    \"\"\"淡出当前页的所有对象，便于下一个章节复用同一个 Scene。\"\"\"\n    if scene.mobjects:\n        scene.play(FadeOut(*list(scene.mobjects)), run_time=run_time)\n\ndef section_title(text):\n    return Text(text, font_size=30, color=MANIM_FOREGROUND).to_edge(UP)\n\ndef labeled_mobject(name, mobject):\n    mobject.scale_to_fit_height(0.58)\n    label = Text(name, font_size=16, color=MANIM_FOREGROUND)\n    return VGroup(mobject, label).arrange(DOWN, buff=0.12)\n\ndef boolean_card(name, operation, color):\n    left = Circle(radius=0.48).shift(LEFT * 0.24)\n    right = Circle(radius=0.48).shift(RIGHT * 0.24)\n    outlines = VGroup(left.copy(), right.copy()).set_fill(opacity=0).set_stroke(MANIM_FOREGROUND, 1, opacity=0.35)\n    result = operation(left, right).set_fill(color, opacity=0.8).set_stroke(color, width=2)\n    drawing = VGroup(outlines, result)\n    label = Text(name, font_size=18, color=MANIM_FOREGROUND)\n    return VGroup(drawing, label).arrange(DOWN, buff=0.15)"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## 01 · 2D 基础图元\n\n`VGroup.arrange_in_grid` 负责布局，`LaggedStart` 让一组对象按顺序进入。改变 `lag_ratio` 可以控制动画重叠程度。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "Scene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "title = section_title(\"01 · 2D primitives\")\nprimitive_items = [\n    (\"Dot\", Dot(radius=0.14, color=PALETTE[2])),\n    (\"Circle\", Circle(color=PALETTE[0], fill_opacity=0.35)),\n    (\"Ellipse\", Ellipse(width=1.5, height=0.8, color=PALETTE[1], fill_opacity=0.35)),\n    (\"Square\", Square(color=PALETTE[3], fill_opacity=0.35)),\n    (\"Rectangle\", Rectangle(width=1.5, height=0.8, color=PALETTE[4], fill_opacity=0.35)),\n    (\"RoundedRectangle\", RoundedRectangle(width=1.5, height=0.8, corner_radius=0.2, color=PALETTE[5])),\n    (\"Triangle\", Triangle(color=PALETTE[2], fill_opacity=0.35)),\n    (\"RegularPolygon\", RegularPolygon(n=6, color=PALETTE[0], fill_opacity=0.35)),\n    (\"Star\", Star(n=5, color=PALETTE[1], fill_opacity=0.45)),\n    (\"Polygon\", Polygon(LEFT, UP, RIGHT, DOWN * 0.7, color=PALETTE[3], fill_opacity=0.35)),\n    (\"Annulus\", Annulus(inner_radius=0.28, outer_radius=0.58, color=PALETTE[4], fill_opacity=0.7)),\n    (\"Sector\", Sector(radius=0.62, angle=2 * PI / 3, color=PALETTE[5], fill_opacity=0.7)),\n]\ncards = VGroup(*(labeled_mobject(name, mob) for name, mob in primitive_items))\ncards.arrange_in_grid(rows=3, cols=4, buff=(0.75, 0.38)).scale_to_fit_width(12.2).shift(DOWN * 0.35)\n\nself.play(Write(title))\nself.play(\n    LaggedStart(*(GrowFromCenter(card[0]) for card in cards), lag_ratio=0.06),\n    run_time=1.7,\n)\nself.play(\n    LaggedStart(*(FadeIn(card[1], shift=UP * 0.1) for card in cards), lag_ratio=0.035),\n    run_time=1.0,\n)\nself.play(Indicate(cards[8][0], color=PALETTE[2]), run_time=0.8)\nself.wait(0.4)"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## 02 · 线、箭头与测量\n\n这些对象通常由端点创建，再用 `VGroup` 组合。`BraceBetweenPoints` 适合做尺寸标注，`Angle` 适合表示两条射线的夹角。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "Scene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "clear_stage(self)\ntitle = section_title(\"02 · Lines, arrows and measurements\")\n\nline = Line(LEFT * 2.4, RIGHT * 2.4, color=PALETTE[0]).shift(UP * 1.55)\ndashed = DashedLine(LEFT * 2.4, RIGHT * 2.4, color=PALETTE[1]).shift(UP * 0.65)\narrow = Arrow(LEFT * 2.4, RIGHT * 2.4, buff=0, color=PALETTE[2]).shift(DOWN * 0.25)\ndouble_arrow = DoubleArrow(LEFT * 2.4, RIGHT * 2.4, buff=0, color=PALETTE[3]).shift(DOWN * 1.15)\nbrace = BraceBetweenPoints(LEFT * 2.4 + DOWN * 1.5, RIGHT * 2.4 + DOWN * 1.5, direction=DOWN)\nbrace_label = Text(\"4.8 units\", font_size=20, color=MANIM_FOREGROUND).next_to(brace, DOWN, buff=0.1)\nleft_group = VGroup(line, dashed, arrow, double_arrow, brace, brace_label).shift(LEFT * 3.0)\n\nray_a = Line(ORIGIN, RIGHT * 2.0, color=PALETTE[4])\nray_b = Line(ORIGIN, RIGHT * 1.5 + UP * 1.35, color=PALETTE[5])\nangle = Angle(ray_a, ray_b, radius=0.7, color=PALETTE[2])\nvertex = Dot(ORIGIN, color=PALETTE[2])\nangle_label = TypstMath(r\"theta\", color=MANIM_FOREGROUND).scale(0.65).next_to(angle, UR, buff=0.05)\nright_group = VGroup(ray_a, ray_b, angle, vertex, angle_label).shift(RIGHT * 3.1 + DOWN * 0.2)\n\nself.play(Write(title))\nself.play(Create(line), Create(dashed), GrowArrow(arrow), GrowArrow(double_arrow), run_time=1.6)\nself.play(GrowFromCenter(brace), FadeIn(brace_label, shift=UP * 0.15))\nself.play(Create(ray_a), Create(ray_b), FadeIn(vertex), Create(angle), Write(angle_label))\nself.play(ApplyWave(double_arrow), Indicate(angle, color=PALETTE[2]))\nself.wait(0.4)"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## 03 · 图形布尔运算\n\n`Union`、`Intersection`、`Difference`、`Exclusion` 会生成新的矢量路径。复杂路径的计算成本较高，真实项目里应避免在每一帧的 updater 中重复构造它们。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "Scene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "clear_stage(self)\ntitle = section_title(\"03 · Boolean operations\")\nboolean_cards = VGroup(\n    boolean_card(\"Union\", Union, PALETTE[0]),\n    boolean_card(\"Intersection\", Intersection, PALETTE[1]),\n    boolean_card(\"Difference\", Difference, PALETTE[3]),\n    boolean_card(\"Exclusion\", Exclusion, PALETTE[4]),\n).arrange(RIGHT, buff=0.85).scale_to_fit_width(11.5).shift(DOWN * 0.25)\n\nself.play(Write(title))\nself.play(\n    LaggedStart(*(DrawBorderThenFill(card[0]) for card in boolean_cards), lag_ratio=0.15),\n    run_time=2.0,\n)\nself.play(LaggedStart(*(FadeIn(card[1], shift=UP * 0.15) for card in boolean_cards), lag_ratio=0.1))\nself.play(Circumscribe(boolean_cards[1], color=PALETTE[2]))\nself.wait(0.4)"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## 04 · 文本、Typst 数学与数字\n\n本项目优先用 `TypstMath` 写数学公式；它与 Markdown 中的 `$...$` 使用同一套 Typst 语法。普通文字使用 `Text` / `MarkupText`，动态数值使用 `DecimalNumber`。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "Scene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "clear_stage(self)\ntitle = section_title(\"04 · Text, TypstMath and numbers\")\nplain = Text(\"Text: reliable labels\", font_size=34, color=MANIM_FOREGROUND).shift(UP * 1.65)\nmarkup = MarkupText(\"MarkupText: <b>bold</b> · <i>italic</i> · <span foreground='#58C4DD'>color</span>\", font_size=30).next_to(plain, DOWN, buff=0.35)\nformula_a = TypstMath(r\"(a + b)^2\", color=PALETTE[2]).scale(1.2).shift(DOWN * 0.15)\nformula_b = TypstMath(r\"a^2 + 2 a b + b^2\", color=PALETTE[1]).scale(1.2).move_to(formula_a)\nnumber = DecimalNumber(0, num_decimal_places=4, color=PALETTE[3]).scale(0.9).shift(DOWN * 1.65)\nnumber_label = Text(\"animated value\", font_size=20, color=MANIM_FOREGROUND).next_to(number, LEFT)\n\nself.play(Write(title))\nself.play(AddTextLetterByLetter(plain), run_time=1.1)\nself.play(FadeIn(markup, shift=UP * 0.2))\nself.play(Write(formula_a))\nself.play(TransformMatchingShapes(formula_a, formula_b), run_time=1.2)\nself.play(FadeIn(number_label), FadeIn(number))\nself.play(ChangeDecimalToValue(number, PI), run_time=1.3, rate_func=smooth)\nself.play(Circumscribe(formula_b, color=PALETTE[2]), Indicate(number, color=PALETTE[2]))\nself.wait(0.4)"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## 05 · 坐标轴、函数、面积与沿路径运动\n\n`Axes.plot` 返回可继续参与动画的 `ParametricFunction`。`Axes.get_area` 产生填充区域；同一条曲线也能直接传给 `MoveAlongPath`。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "Scene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "clear_stage(self)\ntitle = section_title(\"05 · Axes, plots and area\")\naxes = Axes(\n    x_range=[-PI, PI, PI / 2],\n    y_range=[-1.5, 1.5, 0.5],\n    x_length=9.5,\n    y_length=4.6,\n    tips=False,\n    axis_config={\"color\": MANIM_FOREGROUND, \"stroke_opacity\": 0.75},\n).shift(DOWN * 0.35)\ngraph = axes.plot(lambda x: np.sin(2 * x), x_range=[-PI, PI], color=PALETTE[0])\narea = axes.get_area(graph, x_range=[0, PI / 2], color=[PALETTE[1], PALETTE[0]], opacity=0.45)\ngraph_label = MathTex(\n    r\"y = \\sin(2x)\",\n    color=PALETTE[0],\n).next_to(axes, UR, buff=-0.1)\ncursor = Dot(graph.get_start(), radius=0.09, color=PALETTE[2])\n\nself.play(Write(title))\nself.play(Create(axes), run_time=1.0)\nself.play(Create(graph), FadeIn(graph_label), run_time=1.4)\nself.play(FadeIn(area), run_time=0.8)\nself.play(MoveAlongPath(cursor, graph.copy()), run_time=2.2, rate_func=linear)\nself.play(ShowPassingFlash(graph.copy().set_stroke(PALETTE[2], width=8)), run_time=1.0)\nself.wait(0.4)"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## 06 · NumberPlane、参数曲线与向量场\n\n向量场函数接收三维点并返回三维向量；2D 场的 z 分量保持为 0。这里把参数曲线、向量场和运动对象叠加在同一个坐标平面上。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "Scene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "clear_stage(self)\ntitle = section_title(\"06 · Parametric curves and vector fields\")\nplane = NumberPlane(\n    x_range=[-3.5, 3.5, 1],\n    y_range=[-2.5, 2.5, 1],\n    x_length=7.4,\n    y_length=4.8,\n    background_line_style={\"stroke_opacity\": 0.28, \"stroke_width\": 1},\n).shift(DOWN * 0.3)\nfield = ArrowVectorField(\n    lambda point: np.array([-point[1], point[0], 0]),\n    x_range=[-3, 3, 1],\n    y_range=[-2, 2, 1],\n    length_func=lambda norm: 0.38,\n    vector_config={\"max_tip_length_to_length_ratio\": 0.35, \"stroke_width\": 2},\n).shift(DOWN * 0.3)\norbit = ParametricFunction(\n    lambda t: np.array([2.35 * np.cos(t), 1.35 * np.sin(t) - 0.3, 0]),\n    t_range=[0, TAU],\n    color=PALETTE[2],\n)\nparticle = Dot(orbit.get_start(), radius=0.1, color=PALETTE[3])\n\nself.play(Write(title))\nself.play(Create(plane), run_time=1.0)\nself.play(LaggedStart(*(GrowArrow(vector) for vector in field), lag_ratio=0.015), run_time=1.7)\nself.play(Create(orbit), FadeIn(particle))\nself.play(MoveAlongPath(particle, orbit), run_time=2.2, rate_func=linear)\nself.wait(0.4)"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## 07 · Transform 家族与 `.animate`\n\n`Transform` 保留源对象的身份；`ReplacementTransform` 用目标对象替换源对象；`.animate` 适合把多个目标状态写成一条可读的链。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "Scene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "clear_stage(self)\ntitle = section_title(\"07 · Transform and the animate syntax\")\nshape = Square(side_length=2.0, color=PALETTE[0], fill_opacity=0.4)\nshape.shift(LEFT * 3 + DOWN * 0.25)\nshape_label = Text(\"source object\", font_size=20, color=MANIM_FOREGROUND).next_to(shape, DOWN)\ntarget_circle = Circle(radius=1.15, color=PALETTE[1], fill_opacity=0.45).move_to(shape)\nstar = Star(n=7, outer_radius=1.25, inner_radius=0.58, color=PALETTE[3], fill_opacity=0.55).shift(RIGHT * 3 + DOWN * 0.25)\n\nself.play(Write(title))\nself.play(DrawBorderThenFill(shape), FadeIn(shape_label))\nself.play(Transform(shape, target_circle), run_time=1.1)\nself.play(\n    shape.animate.shift(RIGHT * 3).rotate(PI).scale(0.75).set_fill(PALETTE[4], opacity=0.7),\n    FadeOut(shape_label),\n    run_time=1.5,\n    rate_func=smooth,\n)\nself.play(ReplacementTransform(shape, star), run_time=1.1)\nself.play(star.animate.shift(LEFT * 1.5), rate_func=there_and_back, run_time=1.3)\nself.play(Indicate(star, color=PALETTE[2]))\nself.wait(0.4)"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## 08 · 贝塞尔路径、轨迹与强调动画\n\n`CubicBezier` 是路径，`TracedPath` 是 updater 驱动的轨迹。强调类动画通常不改变对象最终状态，适合讲解时把注意力拉回目标。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "Scene",
          "loop": true,
          "playbackRate": 1.15
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "clear_stage(self)\ntitle = section_title(\"08 · Paths, traces and emphasis\")\npath = CubicBezier(LEFT * 5 + DOWN, LEFT * 2 + UP * 2, RIGHT * 1 + DOWN * 2, RIGHT * 4 + UP * 0.6)\npath.set_stroke(PALETTE[0], width=3, opacity=0.7).shift(DOWN * 0.25)\ntraveler = Dot(path.get_start(), radius=0.11, color=PALETTE[2])\ntrail = TracedPath(traveler.get_center, stroke_color=PALETTE[3], stroke_width=5, dissipating_time=0.8)\ntarget = Star(n=6, outer_radius=0.75, color=PALETTE[1], fill_opacity=0.55).move_to(path.get_end())\n\nself.play(Write(title))\nself.add(trail)\nself.play(Create(path), FadeIn(traveler))\nself.play(MoveAlongPath(traveler, path), run_time=2.4, rate_func=linear)\nself.play(FadeTransform(traveler, target))\nself.play(FocusOn(target), Indicate(target, color=PALETTE[2]))\nself.play(ApplyWave(target), run_time=0.9)\nself.play(Wiggle(target), Circumscribe(target, color=PALETTE[3]), run_time=1.1)\nself.play(Flash(target.get_center(), color=PALETTE[2]))\nself.wait(0.4)"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## 09 · ValueTracker、always_redraw 与 updater\n\nupdater 会在每一帧执行。应让 updater 只做轻量更新，并在不再需要时调用 `clear_updaters()`，避免后续动画仍然重复计算。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "Scene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "clear_stage(self)\ntitle = section_title(\"09 · Trackers and updaters\")\ntracker = ValueTracker(0.5)\nnumber_line = NumberLine(x_range=[0, 5, 1], length=8, color=MANIM_FOREGROUND).shift(UP * 0.65)\nmarker = always_redraw(lambda: Dot(number_line.n2p(tracker.get_value()), color=PALETTE[2]))\n\ndef tracked_bar():\n    width = max(0.15, tracker.get_value() * 1.35)\n    return RoundedRectangle(\n        width=width,\n        height=0.65,\n        corner_radius=0.12,\n        color=PALETTE[0],\n        fill_opacity=0.75,\n    ).move_to(LEFT * 4 + RIGHT * width / 2 + DOWN * 1.15)\n\nmeter = always_redraw(tracked_bar)\nreadout = DecimalNumber(tracker.get_value(), num_decimal_places=2, color=PALETTE[3]).scale(0.75)\nreadout.add_updater(lambda mob: mob.set_value(tracker.get_value()).next_to(marker, UP, buff=0.16))\n\nself.play(Write(title))\nself.play(Create(number_line))\nself.add(marker, meter, readout)\nself.play(tracker.animate.set_value(4.6), run_time=2.2, rate_func=smooth)\nself.play(tracker.animate.set_value(1.4), run_time=1.5, rate_func=there_and_back_with_pause)\nself.play(tracker.animate.set_value(3.2), run_time=1.2, rate_func=rush_into)\nmarker.clear_updaters()\nmeter.clear_updaters()\nreadout.clear_updaters()\nself.wait(0.4)"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## 10 · 多对象时序\n\n`LaggedStart` 适合错峰开始；`AnimationGroup` 适合并行编排；`Succession` 明确串行执行。它们可以继续嵌套。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "Scene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "clear_stage(self)\ntitle = section_title(\"10 · Coordinating many animations\")\ncolors = [PALETTE[index % len(PALETTE)] for index in range(8)]\ndots = VGroup(*(Circle(radius=0.34, color=color, fill_opacity=0.75) for color in colors))\ndots.arrange(RIGHT, buff=0.42).shift(DOWN * 0.2)\n\nself.play(Write(title))\nself.play(LaggedStart(*(GrowFromCenter(dot) for dot in dots), lag_ratio=0.12), run_time=1.8)\nself.play(\n    AnimationGroup(\n        *(dot.animate.shift(UP * (0.45 + 0.09 * index)).rotate(PI) for index, dot in enumerate(dots)),\n        lag_ratio=0.08,\n    ),\n    run_time=1.5,\n)\nself.play(\n    Succession(\n        Indicate(dots[0], color=PALETTE[2]),\n        Wiggle(dots[3]),\n        Circumscribe(dots[5], color=PALETTE[3]),\n        Flash(dots[7].get_center(), color=PALETTE[1]),\n    )\n)\nself.play(LaggedStart(*(Uncreate(dot) for dot in reversed(dots)), lag_ratio=0.08), run_time=1.4)\nself.wait(0.4)"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## 11 · 图表与表格\n\n`BarChart` 的柱值可直接动画更新；`Table` 可以使用 `Text` 作为单元格构造器，从而避免普通文本表格依赖 LaTeX。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "Scene"
        }
